TIMetaTemplate.displayName.WarForOurWorldScenario=1899 - War for our World
TIMetaTemplate.description.WarForOurWorldScenario=The aliens reach Earth in 1899. Colonial empires rule the planet, there is no spaceflight, no nuclear weapons and a world economy at two percent of its present size.<br/><h>No tutorial. Very high difficulty.</h>
TIMetaTemplate.displayName.RoswellScenario=1947 - Roswell
TIMetaTemplate.description.RoswellScenario=On the day Roswell reports the recovery of a flying disc, the Cold War is only just beginning. The colonial empires still stand, India is five weeks from independence, Germany, Austria, Japan and Korea are under occupation, and only the United States holds nuclear weapons.<br/><h>No tutorial. High difficulty.</h>
